---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Relaflow | The Business of Relationships"
  description="Relaflow exists to help organizations understand their relationships better and improve how they are developed, managed and retained."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 pt-20 pb-16 md:px-10 md:pt-28 md:pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest2 text-teal">
        About
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl leading-[1.1] sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
        About Us
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        Relaflow is all about the business of relationships.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        Every organization depends on relationships.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        Clients. Partners. Sponsors. Members. Communities. Stakeholders.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        Relaflow exists to help organizations understand these relationships better and improve how they are developed, managed and retained.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        We explore the ideas, practices, information and systems that shape relationship-driven work.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        Our work sits at the intersection of relationships, research, data, operations and organizational growth.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Do -->
  <section class="border-t border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-24">

      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
        What We Do
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3">

        <a
          href="/insights"
          class="group rounded border border-white/10 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-teal/50 sm:p-8"
        >
          <h3 class="text-xl">
            Media and Insights
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65">
            We research and publish ideas about the business of relationships.
            Our insights explore how organizations build, manage and retain relationships,
            identify opportunities and make better use of relationship information.
          </p>

          <span class="mt-6 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-teal">
            Explore Insights →
          </span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/resources"
          class="group rounded border border-white/10 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-teal/50 sm:p-8"
        >
          <h3 class="text-xl">
            Training and Frameworks
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65">
            We turn practical thinking into learning and tools organizations can use.
            Through masterclasses, workshops, playbooks, guides and frameworks, we help
            teams develop better approaches to relationship-related work.
          </p>

          <span class="mt-6 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-teal">
            Explore Resources →
          </span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="group rounded border border-white/10 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-teal/50 sm:p-8"
        >
          <h3 class="text-xl">
            Strategic Advisory
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65">
            Some challenges require deeper support.
            We work with selected organizations on relationship, research, data and
            operational challenges where practical project support can make a difference.
          </p>

          <span class="mt-6 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-teal">
            Contact Us →
          </span>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Approach -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-24">

    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
      Our Approach
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
      Our approach considers both the human and practical sides of relationships,
      including how they are formed, how they develop, how they are maintained,
      and what happens behind the scenes.
    </p>

  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="border-t border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-24">

      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
        What We Value
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

        <div class="rounded border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl">Clear Thinking</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl">Practical Ideas</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl">Better Information</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl">Better Systems</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl">Stronger Connections</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl">Continuous Improvement</h3>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-24">

    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
      The Business of Relationships
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-5 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">
      <p>
        Relaflow is interested in what happens between organizations and the people,
        groups and networks they depend on.
      </p>

      <p>
        We believe relationships are not just a communications issue or a sales activity.
      </p>

      <p>
        They influence growth, retention, partnerships, sponsorships, communities,
        opportunities and long-term organizational development.
      </p>

      <p>
        That is the business of relationships.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>
</Layout>